#: lib/Automation/Integrations/MailPoet/Templates/TemplatesFactory.php:206
msgid ""
"Welcome new subscribers and start building a relationship with them. Send an"
" email immediately after someone subscribes to your list to introduce your "
"brand and a follow-up two days later to keep the conversation going."
